Z||000009||mrfiero||11-04-2001||05:35 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Loki:<BR><B>Also could anyone post a pic of what plug is for the TCC..Just to make sure I unplugged the right thing     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Im test driving right now..BRB</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I just happened to have my digital camera and I'm where my auto. '88 GT is stored!  I'll try to snap a good shot of the plug.....give me a few minutes to get it posted.<P>Here it is.......this shot was taken from the rear looking forward.  The upper left hand corner is the intake "S" tube and in the foreground is the EGR valve.  The TCC switch is the blue plug.  <P>I hope this helps.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TCC_pic.JPG"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 11-04-2001).]||||reg||1
