Z||000012||mrfiero||11-04-2001||08:27 PM||||Oh well......it was worth a shot.  Have you checked your distributor?  Maybe the pick-up coil is bad or the module is pooping out? <P>Heck, it could be a bad coil too.  I had a coil that started cutting out on me......in neutral/park it seemed to rev just fine, but once you started driving it started cutting out.  If you have a spare coil try it and see what happens (before buying a new one).   <P>Have you checked/adjusted the timing?  When was the last time it was completely tuned up?  <P>Hopefully you'll get it figured out soon.<p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 11-04-2001).]||||reg||1
